  "body": "Warm elevated North facing house situated on cul-de-sac road with a peek of the sea. Three double bedrooms, one downstairs and two upstairs. Second kitchen and lounge area downstairs. Please phone 0274878722 for viewing appointment.Rateable value has changed. Also, this property is at the foot of the new Penlink motorway which makes Aukland city easily accessible. Walking distance to supermarket, Doctors, Dentist, Bars, Resturaunt and cafes.",
